What this repository is
  An unofficial fan project for a native PC build of Star Ocean: The Second
  Story (USA, PlayStation) by static recompilation with psxrecomp, plus a
  byte-matching decompilation of the main program.

What this repository contains
  Original tools, scripts, configuration, notes and reconstructed C source,
  licensed under the MIT licence in LICENSE. That licence covers only this
  original material. It grants no rights to Star Ocean: The Second Story or
  to any code, art, music, text or other asset of the game, which belong to
  their owners.

What this repository does not contain
  - No game data: no disc images, no SO2.BIN contents, no extracted files.
  - No BIOS: no Sony BIOS image of any kind.
  - No generated code: the C produced by the recompiler, and any compiled
    game executable, are created on your own PC from your own discs and are
    never published or distributed here.
  You must own the game and supply your own discs. Nothing here helps you
  obtain them.

